# Three images are built from this tree: the QUIC Interop Runner endpoint
# (interop/Dockerfile), and the comparison study's server and load
# generator (comparison/sluice/Dockerfile, comparison/loadgen/Dockerfile).
# They need the Go sources of their modules and the endpoint's entry
# script, nothing else. Everything is excluded by default so that nothing
# outside those files can reach an image.
*
!**/*.go
!**/go.mod
!**/go.sum
!interop/run_endpoint.sh
